window.products.push({"id":633012,"name":"BIA Cordon Bleu Wavy Collection 86-Ounce Oval Baker with Handles, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":41.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/3180YNZEXXL._AC_.jpg","description":"Classically designed with elegant wavy flourishes, this classic 86-ounce (2-11/16-quart) oval baker from BIA Cordon Bleu's Wavy Collection will make an impression as you serve piping hot casseroles to your dinner guests. Crafted from durable ceramic in pure white with an eye-catching wavy rim, the look is casual yet more stylish than typical bakeware. It also blends well with most contemporary dinnerware patterns. Designed to bake in and to serve with, this piece measures 15 inches long and offers convenient handles for easy movement from oven to table. It's safe to use in the microwave, freezer, and dishwasher.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/3180YNZEXXL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BIA Cordon Bleu","source_asin":"B000GG6ECG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-633012","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000GG6ECG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000GG6ECG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":633013,"name":"Victorinox 6 Inch Fibrox Pro Chef's Knife","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.79,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JbMf7ocUL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"A TRUSTED FAVORITE Preferred by both home chefs and culinary professionals, the 6\" Fibrox Pro Chef's Knife can handle nearly every kitchen task imaginable. Crafted with a comfortable handle, superior weight and balance, and a razor sharp edge that rarely requires re-sharpening, this knife is an essential tool for every kitchen. KEY FEATURES High-quality, lightweight European steel. High-quality, lightweight European steel. Handle design reduces hand and wrist fatigue. Handle design reduces hand and wrist fatigue. Fit for dicing, mincing, chopping, slicing, and shredding. Fit for dicing, mincing, chopping, slicing, and shredding. Long, sloping curved blade that “rocks” for effortless mincing and chopping. Long, sloping curved blade that “rocks” for effortless mincing and chopping. Flat spine for extra power to slice through hard-skinned items. Flat spine for extra power to slice through hard-skinned items. Non-slip patented Fibrox Pro handle for a secure and comfortable grip no matter the hand size. Non-slip patented Fibrox Pro handle for a secure and comfortable grip no matter the hand size. National Sanitary Foundation (NSF) approved and dishwasher safe. National Sanitary Foundation (NSF) approved and dishwasher safe. CARE AND USE Be good to your knives and they’ll be good to you. Following these simple guidelines will ensure that you get the longest life out of your knife! CLEANING Victorinox Swiss Army recommends washing all knives by hand. For best results, hand wash your knives with a soapy cloth and dry immediately.  While Fibrox Pro knives are dishwasher safe, we recommend hand washing as dishwashers are designed to spray water at a relatively high pressure, which can jostle the silverware and cause the knives to collide, dulling the edge. SHARPENING For optimum performance, knives should be honed after every couple of uses. Proper and frequent use of a honing steel will keep your knives sharper and performing at their best. FORMERLY FORSCHNER In 1937 Victorinox began selling cutlery in America through a Connecticut distributor called R.H. Forschner & Co. A well-known manufacturer of butcher scales, Forschner soon became the exclusive U.S. distributor for Victorinox knives, and was the name by which Victorinox knives were known.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JbMf7ocUL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Victorinox","source_asin":"B0000CFDD5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-633013","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0000CFDD5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0000CFDD5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
