window.products.push({"id":633046,"name":"BONISON Soft Silicone Orange-shape Ice Cube Tray","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61EA-WdpTeL._AC_SL1317_.jpg","description":"Make your party stand out with the use of these BONISON Silicone Trays! You've bought the perfect decorations, delicious finger foods, and now you need that one item that will set this party apart from all others. BONISON Silicone Ice Cube Tray will do the trick! Bonison Silicone Trays Benefits: Hot & Cold Uses - Faster Baking Process - Non stick - Conventional & Microwave Ovens - Durable - Easy to Clean **Silicone Ice Cube Tray - Make the perfectly designed ice cube in order to add pizzazz to your favorite drinks. Hosting a birthday party, the orange-shaped ice cube tray is the perfect item. Encourage healthy snacking with orange sliced looking treats. Don't stop there, use them daily. Get creative! I'm sure your family would enjoy them. **Silicone Tray for Kids - Make healthy fun treats for the kids! Use BONISON silicone tray in the oven, perfect silicone tray for baking. Use BONISON silicone tray in the fridge! Feel free to add fruit to your favorite gelatin. **BONISON's food grade silicone gives the product a soft texture; it is well-designed with a detailed pattern which would mold awesome shapes on ice or chocolate. For those wonderful arts and crafts individuals, feel free to use silicone trays for crayons and soaps. Silicone trays are great items to share fun moments with your children in kitchen! **Switch to silicone and throw away those rusted pans or those non-stick pans in which the surface has begin to peel and chip away that can be harmful to your health with continuous use. Cooking temperatures are exactly the same as traditional metal molds. No need to panic over the cooking time of your favorite recipe! Do not use harsh abrasives when cleaning the molds. Light-weight (57 g): Item can be folded or rolled and takes up little space. Search BONISON silicone trays for added styles. Buy now!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61EA-WdpTeL._AC_SL1317_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bonison","source_asin":"B010MIV4AO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-633046","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B010MIV4AO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B010MIV4AO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
