window.products.push({"id":633111,"name":"4 Bottle Wall Mounted Liquor Dispenser Bar Butler Bracket Solo Optic Spirit Wine Beer Alcohol Bottle Beverage Stand Revolving Nozzle Drinkware Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81N2W8tOVjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This alcohol drink dispenser is elegant, simple to install, easy to operate, and compact in design. It is used in hotels, bars, kitchens, homes, etc. Regular wine bottles, beer bottles, etc can be placed on it. Specifications: Product name:4 Bottle wall-mounted Wine Liquor Drink Dispenser Material: Aluminum Alloy&ABS Color: Silver Weight: 900g Size: 33cm (Lx 30cm(H) x 43cm Expansion Hight Applicaitons: Rationing alcohol drink, juice, syrup, etc in Bars, kitchens, etc. How to use: *Wash your optics before first use. Ensure that your optics are regularly washed, by running warm water through the optic. Leave to air dry. *First pull down the spring stopper to remove the bottle stopper, then insert the bottle stopper into the bottleneck, and then put the bottle into the dispenser. *The pull rod of the dispenser can be lifted upward, and then put the bottle in the detent position. The pull rod has a built-in micro spring. Suitable for foreign wine, liquor, alcohol drinks etc. *The transparent part can display the volume and the color of the beverage for easy measurement *Just push up, the drink will flow out of the outlet Package Included: 1x 4 45ml optics Wall bracket Note: Due to manual measurement and different monitors, there will be some errors in the product color and size, the actual product shall prevail","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81N2W8tOVjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MUGLIO","source_asin":"B07ZR8GCD6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-633111","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07ZR8GCD6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07ZR8GCD6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
