window.products.push({"id":633165,"name":"150L Extra-Large Laundry Hamper with Lid, Double Laundry Hamper 2 Section with Removable Bags, Dirty Clothes Basket for Storage Sorter, Dual Laundry H","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91KeKrR3nuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Heavy-Duty Linen Fabric Large Hampers for Laundry 2 Compartments with lid 150L Extra-Large hampers for laundry with lid and 2 removable inner bags holds up to 4~5 loads of laundry The double laundry hamper with lid can keep away bad smells and keep your dirty clothes out of sight 👍🏻150L Upgrade Size: The 150L XXX-large laundry basket (24.4×14.2×27.2 inches) comes with 2 compartments (each of 75L)and the same large 2 removable inner bags, super spacious and tall enough to hold all the dirty clothes. Compare to other traditional hampers, the upgrade size design makes you buy one xl laundry hamper to get double the capacity. The large hamper is big enough for 4~5 loads of laundry like an entire family's clothes, toys, towels, blankets, magazines, and other sundries. 💝2 Section Laundry Hamper for Easy Sorting: The 2 compartment laundry hamper for easy sorting like dark and light clothes, wet and dry towels. The modern gray design fits perfectly with bedrooms, bathrooms, living rooms, laundry rooms, dorms, etc. The hampers for laundry 2 compartment is a great gift idea for your friends, parents, housewives, and college students at Mother's - Father's Day, housewarming, and Christmas. 🌟Make Carrying Easier: Tired of carrying an entire laundry hamper? The 2 large laundry bags of dual hamper is easy to grip, carry up and down the stair, from the apartment to the laundry room, etc., and do not need to move the heavy-duty laundry hamper. The 2 detachable liner bags with drawstring stoppers can be fixed in the laundry basket, or drawstring up tight as a dirty clothes bag for traveling. Use the no-tear handles if you need to move the whole double hamper. ✅NO-Bad Smell & Hide the Mess: The detachable lid with sticker attached to the foldable laundry basket has a small loop on the top, making it easy to open and close. Flip down the lid to keep your dirty clothes out of sight, and make your bedroom, or closet look neat. The laundry basket with lid keeps clothes away from dust and prevents bad smells, so you don't have to suffer from the terrible odor, providing you with a tidy home. 🎉Simple Install to Stands Up Well: The sturdy laundry hamper is easy to install for a few minutes and folded to stored in a drawer, cabinet, storage box when not in use. Helping save space and also be suitable for camping and RV trips. The freestanding laundry basket stands up straightly with 8 long poles sturdy and stable, whether it is empty or thrown clothes from a distance, the clothes hamper can keep its shape and not collapse.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91KeKrR3nuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"pheswisom","source_asin":"B0C6K3WM23","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-633165","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C6K3WM23","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C6K3WM23","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
