window.products.push({"id":633175,"name":"Stowaway Products BlowerAway Tray and CurlerAway Tray","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/514DU7z8vxL._AC_.jpg","description":"The BlowerAway system can help anyone store their blow drier in the most ideal storage spot, around the bowl of your sink in your bathroom vanity. The tray is designed and engineered to conform to the sink basin and the edge of the inner cabinet walls. This is the perfect place to store this hard to store item -- the shape of the blow drier actually resembles the shape of the storage space. This blow drier tray is injection molded using a very ridged material that dissipates any of the heat that may remain after use-- even after the most grueling hair styling episode. By installing the blow drier tray in your vanity you utilize the valuable space in the upper part of your vanity. This also frees up the space where you stored that bulky blow drier in the past. Once the blow drier is in place, the false drawer front can be folded back into place concealing the storage area.The BlowerAway is the logical way to store your blow drier. The ideal companion to the BlowerAway storage device is the CurlerAway tray. This tray fits on the right side just under the sink. The tray is made out of a heat resistant plastic that will not warp, melt, or discolor when a curling iron is placed back into the tray immediately after use. These tubes are manufactured to fit any barrel curling iron up to 2 inch diameter. It can also handle most flat irons by inserting it handle first into the tube. Also included with the CurlerAway system are 2 heat resistant tubes that the hot end of the curling iron can be inserted into.These tubes are tested to 450 degrees Fahrenheit which is about 200 degrees over and above the heat of a standard curing iron. This will allow the owner to store their curling irons away directly after use, saving the consumer time normally wasted on waiting for the iron to cool!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/514DU7z8vxL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Stowaway Products","source_asin":"B00L88VTFI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-633175","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00L88VTFI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00L88VTFI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
