window.products.push({"id":633208,"name":"530 Thread Count - Egyptian Cotton Sheet Set by ExceptionalSheets, Twin, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51xSr1GMkqL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Our 100% Egyptian Cotton 530 Thread Count Sheet Sets are the perfect product for anyone looking for ultra soft sheets that still maintain the durability and quality of high thread count luxury linens. These sheets will literally become softer and softer with every wash, so there is no limit to the amount of comfort that they will provide. They're available in multiple size ranges and colors making up almost 200 options! Whether the sheets are a gift for a friend or you are buying for yourself, you know you are getting top-quality luxury with Exceptional Sheets. Egyptian Cotton: Why is Egyptian cotton so much better for your sheets? Quite simply, Egyptian cotton produces longer fibers (up to twice as long as a standard cotton fiber). The longer fibers or staples are easily spun into finer count yarns, and turned into the softest sheets you will ever sleep on. It's that simple! Single Ply: \"Ply\" refers to the number of yarns wrapped together in a single thread. The process of plying creates thicker threads, which will impact a sheet's feel and durability. Finer threads allow for higher thread counts resulting in a softer sheet with an elegant drape. Our Single ply sheets use individual, un-plied threads in the weaving process, resulting in lighter-weight fabric with exceptional drape and softness.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51xSr1GMkqL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ExceptionalSheets","source_asin":"B00C4YFK0K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-633208","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00C4YFK0K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00C4YFK0K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":633209,"name":"Lewis Hyman 0244627 Kona Roman Shade, 27-Inch Wide by 72-Inch Long, Mahogany","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91a2dgHEEOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Beautiful Woven Semi-Private Bamboo Roman Mahogany Shades (also called bamboo blinds) add a fresh, unique and creative window decorating alternative to plain, white blinds. Versatile, bamboo shade styles blend easily with traditional, contemporary, and modern interior decorating. Light filters through semi private mahogany shades, which give a room an airy, uplifting feel. Woven wood roman shades add an eco chic decorator look to any room, and will compliment jute and sisal natural floor coverings. Mahogany bamboo shades are on trend with the hot look of coastal beach seaside decor and protect your furniture from sun damage and fading. Woven wood mahogany bamboo shades compliment furnishings or any style window when layered under sheer fabric panels. Hang shades outside the molding or up to the ceiling to make a window look large.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91a2dgHEEOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lewis Hyman","source_asin":"B01NAWPJW8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-633209","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01NAWPJW8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01NAWPJW8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
