window.products.push({"id":633255,"name":"Norse Tradesman Genuine 12\" Ox-Horn Viking Drinking Horn with Horn Stand & Brass Wolf Adornments | Burlap Gift Sack Included | The Fenrir, Unpolished,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":36.87,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91iLy-btvVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍻 DRINK FROM GENUINE OX HORN - Every Viking horn is made of authentic, ethically sourced ox horn (Certified Livestock Certificate), painstakingly selected for appearance, durability, color pattern and shape. Each Norse inspired mead horn is unique in shape & color & comes packaged in a medieval burlap sack. It's time that you chose a drinking vessel as interesting as you! 🍻 PREMIUM MATERIALS - It all starts with the animals from which our horns are harvested. We only select the finest livestock to provide our drinking horns. Even then, eight out of ten horns do not pass our rigorous quality inspections. Finally, all premium drinking horn models are fitted with a premium brass wolf's head tip and Norse styled brass rim. Norse Tradesman leaves no stone unturned! 🍻 HANDCRAFTED WITH CARE - The secret ingredient of a finely crafted mead horn is the care that is put into the construction. Our artisans have been fashioning drinking horns for generations. Each of our ale horns are hand-selected, hand-cut and hand-polished to near-perfection (we say \"near\" because as handmade items, no horn is entirely perfect). Finally, each stand is crafted and custom fitted to it's horn, ensuring that you can display your horn proudly! 🍻 PICK YOUR STYLE - Choose between multiple sizes (Large ≈ 30 cm / X-Large ≈ 50 cm), finishes (polished or unpolished), engraving styles and stand/holster offerings. Note, however, that horn size and color varies. These are 100% natural items!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91iLy-btvVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Norse Tradesman","source_asin":"B07V9HHR3L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-633255","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07V9HHR3L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07V9HHR3L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":633256,"name":"GUIMIYHY Extra Large Storage Box[3 Pack], Canvas Fabric Storage Baskets with Handles for Cupboards, Wardrobe, Shelves, Bathroom, Clothes, Toys, Towel,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812s+7igHpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Cotton PORTABLE, COLLAPSIBLE & DURABLE - Made from high-quality materials durable linen, and thickened eco-friendly EVA. The sturdy metal rod frame at the top keeps the shape of the basket. Durable and high-quality materials make this basket long-term storage. MULTI-PURPOSE: Utilize as closet organization baskets, clothes box, bathroom clean towel storage, books, magazines, toy storage, dog toys basket, shoe basket, clothes basket, shelf, baby bin, and many other uses. COLLAPSIBLE & EASY MAINTENANCE - The foldable feature allows you to save space when not in use and provides the convenience to bring along with you anywhere. EVA fabric baskets are easy to clean, dusting the basket with a soft dry cloth is recommended. Spot clean with light soapy water when needed. Machine washing is not recommended because of the metal frame inside. DECORATIVE MULTI-STORAGE BASKETS are a stylish, practical alternative to other boring storage solutions. Not only will our baskets help you get organized, but their sophisticated shape and neutral colors will also complement any decor and any room: the bathroom, nursery, playroom, bedroom, living room, laundry room, & more. They make a lovely yet practical gift for friends and family for birthdays, weddings, baby showers, housewarmings, or any other gift-giving occasion! SERVICE-We are confident in the quality of the product. In the process of daily use, if the product has quality problems or have any questions about the product, please feel free to contact us, we are always there.Please note that our baskets are folded for shipping due to their huge size which may result in some creases. Please follow the instructions in the product picture to restore the original shape in at least one or two days.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812s+7igHpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GUIMIYHY","source_asin":"B0BHTRTJGT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-633256","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BHTRTJGT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BHTRTJGT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
