window.products.push({"id":633416,"name":"Floating Pasta Drying Rack | Clamp Anywhere | Works for Fresh Pasta, Reusable Bags, Herbs and More","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kKm54DnrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Floating Pasta Drying Rack by Wandaffull is the first drying rack that hangs anywhere, eliminating the risk of tipping and also freeing up valuable counter space. Not only for fresh homemade pasta, it is also great for drying reusable bags, herbs, light cookware and more. With ten feet of rail to hang pasta from, the floating pasta rack holds longer noodles and more of them than any other. How does it float? A custom-built clamp can be attached to any surface (up to 1 inch thick) at any orientation. Clamp under wall cabinets, on cupboard doors, table edges, or on the back of a chair. The stainless steel plate on the pasta rack then slides over to the clamp's mounting bracket, securely fitting it into place. When you're making pasta- you need all the counter space you can get. With Wandaffull’s Floating Pasta Rack, you can place the clamp somewhere ideal that's out of way where the pasta can dry safely. The easy mounting mechanism allows you to fill the wooden rack with pasta while holding it, and then mount it to the clamp.  Beyond hanging noodle, it's also ideal for drying reusable bags, herbs, and more. The clamp by alone can also serve as a movable hook for hang-drying oversized cookware such as colanders, pots, etc.Thoughtful design and perfected craftsmanship come together to bring you a simple, refined and elegant solution to all your drying woes. Features: 360 degree clamping system allows for the pasta rack to be securely mounted at angle angle Floating design allows the pasta rack to be clamped anywhere, so there’s no limit to how long your pasta can be.  Floating design also frees up counter space, which comes at a premium when making fresh pasta at home Twelve 10-inch rods give you 10 feet of real estate to dry your pasta Also for drying reusable bags, herbs, light cookware and more Designed in Pittsburgh, PA12”(L) x 12”(W) x 1.5”(H)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kKm54DnrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wandaffull","source_asin":"B088QS1RP5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-633416","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088QS1RP5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B088QS1RP5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
