window.products.push({"id":633470,"name":"ExtraCharm Insulated Lunch Bag for Men Women Adult, Dual-Compartment Large Lunch Box Reusable Lunchbox Cooler for Work Office Picnic","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91TmBGsTnSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SUPER CAPACITY - Up to 15 quart | Measures 10.3\" L x 7.5\"W x 10.3\"H. The lunch box for men is tall but also wide enough for most normal-sized containers. The insulated lunch bag can fit a full day's worth of food( not just lunch). A worthy choice for hungry commuters! Plus, if you don't want to take anything else to work, you have this large lunch bag with a lot of pockets. With 2 mesh side pockets, front and back zipper storage pockets, you'll have plenty of space for your lunch and necessity. 2 SEPARATE COMPARTMENTS - Featuring double compartments, the lunch bag for men allows 2 temperature zones to separate cold drinks from hot food. A warm zone for holding hot meals like soup, pasta, while a cold zone for beverages, salad, sandwiches and fruits, can keep both warm food and cold items at the right temperature individually. What's more, the mens lunchbox for work with a double-decker structure makes it easy to organize everything. Ideal for avid organizers and meal packers. POWERFUL INSULATION - Our mens lunch bag uses excellent insulating properties foam insulation, foam up to 8 millimeters thick to help the lunch box retain warm or cold for up to 8 hours. (or longer when used with an ice pack). Whenever you want to snack on some hot soup or chilled yogurt, this large lunch box can handle it. Perfect for carrying lunch to office, school, picnic, camping, beach, parties, fishing, car trip, travel, park, sports, events, gym, kayaking, shopping, outdoors, etc. NEVER SWEAT& FAST CLEAN - The lunch bags for men feature fully lined interiors and thermo-Compression technology, indeed seamless! In case your water bottle or food container springs a leak, the lunch cooler for men work with leakproof fabric will guard against leaks wherever at home, car seat or office desk for your peace of mind. Besides, the soft interior allows us to easily wipe it out with a paper towel or washcloth. Great for those who don't have a lot of time to clean the men lunch bags. FUNCTIONAL & LONG-LASTING - Lunch boxes for adults are meant to look professional. The concise style is exactly suitable for the office. Available in 3 exterior colors, suited for men & women. Moreover, with dual handles and a shoulder strap, it can be worn as a handbag or messenger bag. Many handles and straps are padded with cushions, making the lunch bag comfortable to carry. Plus, a ripstop oxford outer shell adds durability for trips from home to the office, holds up to countless outings.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91TmBGsTnSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ExtraCharm","source_asin":"B09BMRN952","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-633470","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09BMRN952","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09BMRN952","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
