window.products.push({"id":633474,"name":"TECHMILLY Soft Fluffy Chenille Bathroom Rugs, Non Slip Absorbent Bath Mats for Bathroom, Washable and Quick Dry, Green, 20\" x 32\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81IAe9LA7vL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Enjoy Softness & Comfort: Hate touching the cold floor directly after bathing? Our soft dense chenille bath mats for bathroom floor, measuring 1.16 inches high, could shield feet from the cold floor and soothe sole tiredness. Besides, with warm and cozy features, our chenille rugs will be the favorites of your dogs or cats. Ultra Absorbent: When you are stepping out of the bathtub, shower, or standing at the sink, our 1600GSM absorbent bath mat with thousands of thick chenille shags could absorb water quickly and much to keep your feet and floor dry.The resulting quick-dry feature also makes rugs an excellent choice for bathrooms or other spaces with high humidity. Refuse Slipping: Fear of slipping in the bathroom? With hot melt adhesive backing and specially prepared rug grippers, our bathroom rugs will NOT SLIDE even on wet floors, which maximizes the safety of you and your family, but for hygiene please try to place rugs on a CLEAN, DRY surface. Multiple Colors & Sizes: Available in a wide variety of colors and sizes, our bathroom mats could coordinate beautifully with most decor. It will be an easy task for you to choose rugs in different colors to match your bathroom style or design ideas, and right sizes to match the dimensions of your bathroom floor. Decorate Your Bathroom: A luxury chenille rug adds a pop of color to an otherwise neutral bathroom while breaking up the modern furnishings. This bathroom floor decor idea is perfect for those who like modish design but can't resist the beautiful richness of boho. Washing Care: Our washable bathroom rugs are very easy to clean. Just need to remove the tapes, wash them with water, and air dry to restore stickiness. Then throw rugs in the washing machine to machine wash and tumble dry ON LOW, or hang dry.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81IAe9LA7vL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TECHMILLY","source_asin":"B0BMLMDDDR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-633474","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BMLMDDDR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BMLMDDDR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
