window.products.push({"id":633497,"name":"INKBIRD 3-in-1 Instant Read Thermometer for Cooking Temperature,Infrared Thermometer Meat Thermometer with Probe,Food Thermometer with Timer for BBQ,G","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614tlaV+gGL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"3-in-1 Instant IR Thermometer for Infrared and Probe Measure and Timer:It is both infrared thermometer for surface temperatures and food thermometer with probe.Infrared thermometer measure with non-contact, and the built-in stainless 183°folded probe can measure food internal temperature.This food thermometer is designed temp alarm and timer function, with a positive/countdown setting range of up to 990 minutes,which can remind you of the best time to cook. -58℉to 572℉Wide Temperature Range and ±1℉Accuracy and -9℉~9℉Calibration: The infrared thermometer can accurately sense the surface temperature within 0.5 seconds with 0.95 infrared emissivity (-58℉~482℉/-50℃~200℃), and the cooking thermometer with food-grade probe can read internal temperatures accurately to ±1°F within 2-3 seconds (-58°F to 572°F/-50°C- 300°C). It supports two ways of temperature calibration from -9℉~9℉(-4.9℃~4.9℃). Built-in Preset Menus of 5 Doneness of 5 Common Meats and Custom:The digital thermometer contains a preset menu of five common meats (chicken/pork/beef/lamb/turkey) and five doneness to help you find the right doneness to suit your tastes and remind the best cooking time instead of miss it. Rechargeable Battery and Readable Backlit Screen:The IR thermometer can lasts up to 8 hours with 250mAh lithium battery and can be fully charged in just 1 hour that is more convenient and durable than traditional battery powered.The instant thermometer has a backlit LCD screen for clear readings in different lights and angles and the magnetic design is more convenient for storage. Easy to Use for Everyone:This instant read thermometer supports HOLD function an°F/℃ switch.Its sensitive Motion-activated ON/OFF, can save power with Auto sleep when not in use.And its target alarm will beep to remind you when reaches your target temperature.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614tlaV+gGL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Inkbird","source_asin":"B0BRPZF7SC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-633497","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BRPZF7SC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BRPZF7SC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
