window.products.push({"id":633555,"name":"Brazilian Blue Agate Coasters | Natural Geode Stone Coasters | 4-Pack Drink Coasters | Agate Slices in Wooden Gift Box |Random Size 3.5 ~ 4\" with Gold","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81tuzD8N8eL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Symbol of Creativity The elegant and captivating agate coasters each strives for unique character. Because of this, agate stone is a symbol of creativity. Classy and timeless, they will be conversation magnets that attract your guests and friends, and become the center of everyone’s attention. Stone of Imagination The capricious pattern and the blue color will take your imagination to oceans, mountains, the Galaxy, or wherever your mind decides to wander. Our spinning daily life needs quiet moments and this coaster set may help you do just that. Festive Yet Practical The gorgeous crystal stone enhances your home decor and brightens your room. The coaster set can be appreciated as marvelous art pieces but can also set off your drink ware such as coffee mugs or wine glasses. Its festive sophistication does not prevent it from being useful. Order Includes Presented in an elegantly simple wooden box, a set of 4 agate coasters—with diameter ranging from 3.5~4” and 12 rubber bumpers—are eager to cheer, brighten, soothe and be part of your daily life. No Two Stones are Alike If you receive a set that does not look exactly like the ones shown in the pictures, congratulations! You will not find two identical agate slices anywhere in the world and it only proves the point that they are natural stones. They are perfect presents for weddings, housewarming parties, birthdays, Christmas and holidays. Enjoy and appreciate the beauty the coaster set has to offer. Order Today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81tuzD8N8eL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Simply Salubrious","source_asin":"B07YVJ2XV5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-633555","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YVJ2XV5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YVJ2XV5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":633556,"name":"Thomas Kinkade Snowfall Express Illuminated Snowglobe Train","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":139.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81GakgoHkbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"All aboard for an unforgettable ride on the Snowfall Express! The shimmering snow may be flying, but that's not going to stop these top-hatted snowmen from chugging down the tracks, making sure everyone's holidays are bright and festive. Now, you're invited to climb aboard for an unforgettable ride on the Thomas Kinkade Snowfall Express Snowglobe train, a limited-edition first-ever exclusively from The Bradford Exchange. Three individually hand-cast and hand-painted train cars, adorned with silvery snowflakes and piled high with glittery snow, feature Thomas Kinkade's most treasured holiday scenes recreated in full color on the sides. Guiding the classic steam engine through the snowdrifts, the smiling conductor pops his head out of the side and gives a friendly wave. On the rear car, two more dapper snowmen keep busy trimming the holiday tree with ornaments and garland.Holiday magic awaits you in the center car too, where a clear glass snowglobe contains a festive scene of children building a snowman along with holiday revelers taking a walk in the snow. With a flip of a switch, the Thomas Kinkade-inspired Victorian home inside the snowglobe lights up from within, casting a soft glow, while a flurry of snow swirls and a medley of 8 favorite holiday carols plays! All 3 cars illuminate with LED lights, including the headlamp and conductor's booth on the engine, and upward lights on the two snowmen decorating the tree on the third car. The perfect addition to any snowman Christmas decoration display, it's ideal on a tabletop, mantel, window sill or shelf. Strong demand is expected for this premiere Thomas Kinkade snowglobe train, so don't wait. Order now!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81GakgoHkbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Bradford Exchange","source_asin":"B073SG43NX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-633556","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B073SG43NX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B073SG43NX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
