window.products.push({"id":633581,"name":"LOSAND - Bento Box That Makes Foods the Most Delicious When Using the Microwave - FLEXBOX Platinum Silicone Lunch Container – Mixtureproof and Leakpro","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61spSqVYEDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍊 What kind of lunchbox keeps your food fresh without drying it out in the microwave? What type of lunchbox prevents the coating from coming off when washing? Is there really such thing as a lunchbox that can be used for a long time without ever scratching or breaking? Is the lunchbox free of harmful substances and chemicals? Introducing LOSAND FLEXBOX; that never leaks regardless of contents due to its patented sealing power and is made from silicone instead of plastic or glass. 🥐 HOW DO I USE IT? Our lid patented technology prevents food from leaking and the mixing of food from different compartments. It can be used in refrigerators, freezers, microwaves, ovens, and dishwashers and makes food easy to heat up because it does not deform. FLEXBOX is made from high-quality silicone that is baked for 4 hours at 200 degrees like ceramics. FLEXBOX is the best lunch box because it keeps your food tasting fresh for longer than traditional lunch boxes. 🍠 WHO IS THIS PRODUCT FOR? We recommend our lunch box for customers who have a hard time finding a suitable container to store their meals as well as those who want to put an end to microplastics, chemicals, and other substances that are harmful to humans and the planet. All of our containers and lids are made from only high-quality silicone and do not deform in temperatures ranging from -58°F to 482°F. 🍌 WHERE AND WHEN CAN I USE IT? Our patented leak-proof lid is so strong that you can rest assured knowing that your bag will be just fine on-the-go. The LOSAND container is made with an air-tight lid that keeps fruits, vegetables, purees, formulas, meats, etc. fresh for a longer time than other containers. It is durable yet made without harmful substances, so it can be used by the whole family and is perfect for packing school lunches or meal prep usage. 🥕 HOW IS YOUR PRODUCT DIFFERENT? Did you know that silicone also has grades? We are almost the only factory worldwide that uses FUMED SILICA (the highest grade of silicone). You can tell the difference in quality of our products just by touching them. If you are tired of endlessly searching for better products because each new purchase leaves you disappointed, or just want to buy the right product the first time, LOSAND FLEXBOX IS PERFECT FOR YOU. We believe that LESS IS MORE.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61spSqVYEDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Losand","source_asin":"B09HK1CSBX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-633581","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09HK1CSBX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09HK1CSBX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
