window.products.push({"id":633653,"name":"FBTS Basic Hook Less Shower Curtains with Liner 71x77 Inch Waffle Pattern Two Layers Fabric Shower Curtains Replaceable Lining Water Resistant, 1 Pack","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WI+YafXCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"QKHOOK brings you a healthy fabric hook less shower curtain with snap in liner, the neutral white color suits any decor style.PRODUCT DESCRIPTION- Package includes: 1 pc QKHOOK hook less shower curtain with snap in liner, it has two layers, the outer layer is white waffle pattern fabric, the inner layer is water-proof, removable and replaceable.- Color: White.- Dimension: 71x77 inch.- Outer Layer Fabric Features: Made from high quality polyester fabric, waffle pattern, it doesn’t give off unpleasant odors like PVC or plastic can.- Inner Layer Fabric Features: Made from high quality specially processed polyester fabric, which has excellent water resistent effect.- Patent Grommet Design: Top of the shower curtain is grommet style, easily to hang it.- Covered Buttons Design: 12 pcs snap-in buttons, quickly to remove the liner for wash or replacement.- Light-filtering Mesh Window: Mesh window at head levels to transmit light into the shower area, create a dry and clean environment.- Lining Bottom Ultrasonic Hem Design: The unique stitch-free hem at the bottom allows water to run off easily.HOW TO CARE- Specially designed to be machine washed makes the shower curtain’s cleaning extremely easy. Fabric stays crisp after multi-washes. Shrink resistance, easy to clean and maintain.RETURN POLICY- If for any reason you are not satisfied, send a simple email and receive a 100% money-back refund, absolutely no questions asked!- Our #1 goal is to find you top quality deals, at great discounted low prices, and to provide you with the ultimate better customer service in the world. Shop happy & confident with our 100% money-back guarantee, you deserve it!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WI+YafXCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FBTS Basic","source_asin":"B07FJVTRW2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-633653","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07FJVTRW2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07FJVTRW2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
