window.products.push({"id":633876,"name":"JML Queen Comforter Set Bed in a Bag, 8 Piece Cationic Dyeing Comforter Set (490GSM) with 2 Pillow Shams and Sheet Set, Ultra Soft Microfiber All Seas","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":65.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81GS62tk2HL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"THE BEST OF BOTH WORLD - Inspired by the simple, natural and minimalistic look of flax fabric, our cationic dyeing comforter set uses ultra high thread microfiber to combine the classic appearance of flax linen with the softness of Egyptian cotton. The JML Queen Comforter Set immediately adorns your bedroom with an elegant touch. COMFORTABLE & WARM - The use of skin-friendly high-density fiber ensures that the JML Cationic Dyeing Twin Comforter Set wraps around your body as soft as the cloud, while the 490 GSM (250 GSM filling and 120 GSM Cationic dyeing fabric each side )keeps you warm and cozy in cold weather. NON-FADING - We employed the latest cationic dyeing technology to manufacture the wear resistant queen bed comforter set. The color and texture of the JML Cationic Dyeing queen comforter set will not fade overtime, even under intensive washes. WRINKLE RESISTANT - The premium polymer material of the comforter set is soft and durable. No matter how many times you wash and fold the comforter set, the comforter set queen remains wrinkleless and lint-free. ECO FRIENDLY PACKAGING - We engineered our signature comforter set vacuum packing technique to reduce greenhouse gas emissions. Each comforter set vacuum bag uses 50% less plastic and provides maximum cleanness and portability. EASY CARE – The comforter set is stain, shrink and wrinkle resistant. Machine wash in cold water, no bleach, no iron, tumble dry in low heat, do not wash with dark colors. CUSTOMER CARE- We are committed to your satisfaction. If you are not satisfied with our comforter set, please contact us with no hesitation. WHAT DO YOU GET - 8-Piece Comforter Set for Queen Bed includes 1x Bed Comforter 90\"x90\", 2x Pillowcases 20\"x30\", 2x Pillow Sham 20\"x26\", 1x Bed Skirt 60\"x80\", 1xFlat Sheet 90\"x102\", 1x Fitted Sheet 60\"x80\" with 14\" Deep Pocket.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81GS62tk2HL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JML","source_asin":"B09721LHVJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-633876","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09721LHVJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09721LHVJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
