window.products.push({"id":633911,"name":"Wooden Candle Cups Country-Style, 2-5/8 inch with 7/8 inch Taper Candle Hole, Set of 4 Ufinished Candlesticks, by Woodpeckers","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51MK1dHORES._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"DIY A VINTAGE-STYLE COUNTRY CANDLE CUP - Can't find a candlestick holders set that suits your décor juuuust right? With unfinished candlesticks you can decorate a made-for-this-room accent. Perfect for crafting elegant, shabby chic, or rustic farmhouse candle holders. SATISFY YOUR DÉCOR CRAVINGS… AND YOUR BUDGET! -No need to splurge on decor accents  - just  go with these unfinished candlesticks. The shape is beautiful and classic -  ideal for mantelpiece decor/ centerpieces. And the price? Decorating-on-a-budget beauty. CANDLE SAFETY ALERT! - These candlesticks are smooth, solid, and stand securely on your surface. They are also WOODEN. If you light candles in them, put the candles out once they burn down to one inch. And NEVER leave lit candles unattended. (Candlestick size: 2-5/8 inch, hole size: 7/8 inch) HELP PRESERVE THE PLANET WITH YOUR PURCHASE - We're proud supporters of the Arbor Day Foundation. Wood is the canvas for our creativity, and helping plant more trees is our way of giving back to the planet. WOOD PARTS BY CRAFTERS, FOR CRAFTERS -At Woodpeckers, crafting and building with wood is our thing. Bringing you more of the wood craft supplies you love is our fun. And seeing pics and vids of your creative creations - that's our after-we-finish-today's-work treat! Have questions about your wooden candle holder? Please do get in touch.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51MK1dHORES._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Woodpeckers","source_asin":"B07NJCNMZ3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-633911","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07NJCNMZ3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07NJCNMZ3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
