window.products.push({"id":633964,"name":"Ice cream scoop by The Kitchen Panda - Premium Quality - Heavy Duty - with comfort grip rubber handle - serves perfect size scoops of ice cream. Amazi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31iTqpcXz+L._AC_.jpg","description":"While there are so many ice cream scoops on the market today, people who love a frozen treat for an afternoon snack or dessert after dinner are always looking for the best to suit their needs. It may be easy to dismiss the idea of the perfect ice cream scoop. After all, all it has to do is transfer this delicious snack from the carton to a bowl or cone. Anyone who has done this in the past understands the aggravation that can ensue. The Kitchen Panda has something new and better than ever before. We have listened to customer feedback, complaints and ideas about ice cream scoops and this is what we have come up with. Have you ever bent the spoon when trying to dish out very hard ice cream? Have you ended up with strange shaped lumps that did not fit in a cone rather than a smooth sphere? Or perhaps everything worked well with your old scoop up until the moment of dishing out ice cream when the scoop slipped out of your hands and everything fell on the floor. All of these problems will be things of the past when you choose the new and better ice cream scoop from The Kitchen Panda. This ice cream scoop by The Kitchen Panda is in a bright and cheery orange color to make it easy to find in a drawer full of other utensils. It is created with strong yet lightweight zinc alloy metal. Wet metal can be slippery, so we created the ice cream scoop with a great anti-slip grip. The rubber is grooved slightly to help your fingers stay in place and is 100% BPA free. The company is dedicated to producing only the highest quality items with no potentially dangerous or hazardous materials whatsoever. Limited quantities available and we cannot guarantee this special pricing, so be sure to click buy NOW!!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31iTqpcXz+L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Kitchen Panda","source_asin":"B010JK62RK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-633964","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B010JK62RK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B010JK62RK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
